# E-commerce Customer Analytics

## Project Description
This project analyzes e-commerce customer behavior and purchasing patterns.

## Features
- Customer behavior analysis
- Purchase analysis
- Product similarity analysis
- Personalized product recommendations
- Recommendation evaluation

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Scikit-learn
- VS Code

